  "about": {
    "title": "About the Generation Force set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Generation Force is a Yu-Gi-Oh! TCG booster set released on 16 August 2011, in the ZEXAL era. It has 100 cards, and with the 13 other rarities there are 113 to collect in all.",
